    "background_story": "Deep in the misty forests of California, Goofy, a lovable and adventurous raccoon, stumbled upon a hidden clearing filled with the majestic Umbellularia trees. Entranced by their unique, umbrella-like leaves, Goofy made it his mission to learn everything about these fascinating plants. He spent his days exploring the forest, collecting seeds, and studying the trees' medicinal properties. As he delved deeper into his research, Goofy discovered that the Umbellularia trees possessed remarkable healing powers. He began to share his findings with the other forest creatures, using the trees' extracts to create remedies for their ailments. Goofy's dedication to the Umbellularia trees earned him the title of 'Forest Healer,' and his legacy lived on as a testament to the wonders of these extraordinary plants.",
